Query:
--Description: For 2021, count how many distinct counties / forecast-zones (“cz_name”) reported
--hurricane events in each state and list those zone names.  This avoids the missing
--“event_name” column and instead uses the always-present “cz_name” field.
SELECT  "state",
        COUNT(DISTINCT "cz_name")                                         AS "unique_hurricane_area_count",
        LISTAGG(DISTINCT "cz_name", ', ') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY "cz_name") AS "hurricane_areas"
FROM    "NOAA_DATA_PLUS"."NOAA_HISTORIC_SEVERE_STORMS"."STORMS_2021"
WHERE   "event_type" ILIKE '%hurricane%'
GROUP BY "state"
ORDER BY "unique_hurricane_area_count" DESC
LIMIT 20
Answer:
state,unique_hurricane_area_count,hurricane_areas
